sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React app
    participant API as Backend API
    participant AG as LLM service (LangGraph)
    participant M as Ollama · Qwen 3.6
    User->>UI: types a question
    UI->>API: POST /api/assistant/chat/stream (JWT)
    Note over API: builds the dataset (reconciled trials,<br/>vocabulary, custom fields) and the agent<br/>options from Settings → AI assistant
    API->>AG: POST /v1/agent/stream
    loop tool loop (bounded)
        AG->>M: messages + tools
        M-->>AG: tool calls
        Note over AG: runs the tools on the dataset
    end
    Note over AG: verifies the draft answer<br/>(numbers, trial IDs, conflicts, gaps)
    opt checks fail (bounded)
        AG->>M: reviewer feedback
        M-->>AG: revised answer
    end
    AG-->>API: events: step logs … answer, done
    API-->>UI: relays the events as they happen
    UI-->>User: answer, sources, fact-check badge, Inspection log
